  "guidance": "The CKAN connector allows users to read and write data to/from CKAN servers.\n\n### Read\n### Recipe\n```yaml\nread:\n  - ckan:\n      host: https://data.example.com\n      dataset: my-dataset\n      file: example.csv\n      api_key: my_key\n```\n\n### Function\n```python\nfrom wrangles.connectors import ckan\ndf = ckan.read(\n    host='https://data.example.com',\n    dataset='my-dataset',\n    file='example.csv',\n    api_key='my_key'\n)\n```\n\n### Write\n\n### Recipe\n```yaml\nwrite:\n  - ckan:\n      host: https://data.example.com\n      api_key: my_key\n      dataset: my-dataset\n      file: example.csv\n```\n\n### Function\n```python\nfrom wrangles.connectors import ckan\nckan.write(\n    df,\n    host='https://data.example.com',\n    api_key='my_key',\n    dataset='my-dataset',\n    file='example.csv'\n)\n```"
